        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "This privately owned development comprises just 19 architecturally designed homes, offering an exclusive opportunity in a highly desirable rural setting.\r\n\r\nIdeally located, Belcarra is just 9 km from Castlebar, 20 km from Claremorris, and 24 km from Westport, providing convenient access to nearby towns while enjoying the peace of village living.\r\n\r\nThis three bedroom, semi-detached home of approximately 95 sq m / 1, 022 sq ft have been thoughtfully designed to provide spacious accommodation, and extensive glazing to provide naturally bright homes. Designed with great attention to detail, featuring Quartz worktops and generous fitted modern designed cabinetry by Kube Kitchens, contemporary tiling, and locally sourced feature stone detail to the front elevation."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "-Superb 3-bedroom semi-detached home for sale\r\n-Highly sought after residential location\r\n-A low density private housing development \r\n-Fitted with quality kitchens, stone worktops, up-stands and quality tiling\r\n-Air to water heating system & air ventilation system\r\n-Modern bathroom & WC tiling supplied and fitted\r\n-2 parking spaces to the front\r\n-2m patio to rear, seeded lawn\r\n-Stone cladding facade"
